// GAMEPLAY.md's test chain: the creatures sicken, a healer wants a sample, a maker a cure, and the
// cure must be tried on one of them. Talk, kill and loot, talk, gather, receive, use, talk. A recipe
// of segments (questSegments/sickness*.json5) in a fixed order, so the intro is always this chain.
{
  intro: true,
  segments: ["sicknessAsk", "sicknessSample", "sicknessMaker", "sicknessHerbs", "sicknessSalve", "sicknessTry"],
}
